    "name": "Redis Triage Consumer",
    "description": "Stream consumer for oneshotllc: pops queue:oneshotllc, rejects items without stream, claims via INCR seen:{owner}/{repo}#{n}, generates the TDD/BDD spec via the Claude shim, posts it as an issue comment. Comment failures are error executions.",
    "active": true,
    "isArchived": false,
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "f16ca477-f460-400f-bcff-5b32ccca7cbb",
