      {
        "id": "35377fbc-a2ab-4c1d-b632-60ccaecfce36",
        "name": "Sticky Note 678dc2a5",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          174,
          -50
        ],
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## Redis queue consumer (stream: oneshotllc)\n\nRPOP drains queue:oneshotllc (fed only by the sorter). Items without `stream` are rejected with an error.\n\nINCR on seen:{owner}/{repo}#{number} is the atomic first-winner claim (TTL 7d). After the spec comment is posted: label `hold` is applied (C3, .github#30) and spec:{owner}/{repo}#{n} is set (no TTL). Removing `hold` is Brian's approval; the sorter's approval path then pushes the issue to queue:build:<stream> exactly once (build:{key} INCR).\n\nPublish Spec Comment fails the execution on error (C1).",
          "color": 4,
          "width": 972,
          "height": 312
        }
      },
      {
